From 9d828d4edd3a2f173a2ce8e6863d318244c9943b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gaurav Rambaran Yadav <archduke1337@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:23:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make Grovy local-first and adopt HeroUI

Grovy no longer has accounts. The Appwrite auth, account, password-reset and
user-sync surface is gone, and everything the player remembers now lives in
localStorage behind a small typed store.

Persistence
- Add app/lib/localStore.ts (library, preferences, search history) and rebuild
  offlineCache.ts on top of it.
- Fix library writes being silently dropped: playlists are saved as whole
  collections instead of being compared by ID, so adding or reordering songs
  inside an existing playlist persists.
- Fix the library being wiped on load. Saves are now gated on an explicit
  hydrated flag, so the pre-hydration empty state can never overwrite storage.
- Sync open tabs through the browser's own `storage` event only. A self-
  dispatched change event would re-enter the same tab's writer and loop.

UI
- Adopt HeroUI across the navbar, favorites, playlists, add-to-playlist sheet,
  sleep timer, player controls, mini player and history list.
- Replace window.alert/confirm with toasts and a styled confirm dialog.
- Add a shared theme hook so the navbar and document root cannot disagree.

Backend
- Consolidate the duplicated radio and related routes into app/lib/discovery.ts.
- Remove the local-file branch that used require('fs') and broke on Vercel,
  plus unused /api/charts, /api/track/info and four dead client helpers.
- Tighten the CSP, replace the blanket cache header with per-route caching,
  and bound the rate limiter's map.

Fixes
- Thumbnails no longer request maxresdefault, which 404s for many videos.
- Stop a 27px horizontal overflow on phones.
- Skip Vercel Analytics off-platform instead of requesting a missing script.

Housekeeping
- Drop unused deps (appwrite, node-appwrite, @vercel/blob, next-pwa,
  autoprefixer) and the inert Tailwind v3 config.
- Update README, the terms page and .env.example for the local-first app.
- Add regression tests for persistence, the store caps and cross-tab sync.
